+// Jep (co-op, coop-pt1111e): the pointer in a linked game (npc.hpp's DialogNpcSetCoopHooks). The selection is every copy's (the
+// session steps on every copy from the agreed pads), so a hover moved it on the pointer's own copy alone: two copies confirmed two
+// choices. With the hooks a hover is this screen's own hand (g_hover, drawn by DialogNpcHoverDraw) and a click's choice goes to
+// every copy by the pick hook (a command) beside its Cross.
+namespace {
+DialogNpcPickFn    g_pick_hook = nullptr;
